{"id":"n60356-2-7","stage":5,"title":"불모지 · 荒地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60356-2-7-1","ko":"경기 결과가 어떻게 됐습니까?","zh":"比赛结果怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}},{"text":"결과가","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결과가","audio":"/audio/0634875e15476fcec42c.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"됐습니까?","meaning":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","explanation":"되다：发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐습니까","audio":"/audio/b0db41e71b0ef276b771.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状