；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"이기다","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71688","senseId":"1","lemma":"이기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이겨","audio":"/audio/9a9f22b167c512a137c3.mp3"}},{"text":"화제를","meaning":"话题","explanation":"화제：话题；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화제","audio":"/audio/1f7e2fb6cc245d3a31f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87601","senseId":"1","lemma":"화제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화제를","audio":"/audio/20b25de257453e3e36a7.mp3"}},{"text":"모았습니다.","meaning":"吸引，集中，聚集","explanation":"모으다：吸引，集中，聚集；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"7","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모았습니다","audio":"/audio/16aaa557f87f9986f81c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"fd0b5a15f2ed0197","term":"불모지","zh":"荒地，不毛之地","audio":"/audio/fd0b5a15f2ed0197da87.mp3","entryId":"60356","definition":"(喻义)没有进行任何开发或发展的地方；或指那种状态。","pronunciation":["불모지"]},{"id":"f2080c5a361a1263","term":"강대국","zh":"强国","audio":"/audio/f2080c5a361a12637856.mp3","entryId":"17512","definition":"经济及军事上力量强大且领土广阔的国家。","pronunciation":["강대국"]},{"id":"f623afa3b5ca8273","term":"이기다","zh":"赢，战胜，打败","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3","entryId":"71688","definition":"在打赌、竞赛或战争等中压制对手，创造佳绩。","pronunciation":["이기다"]},{"id":"1f7e2fb6cc245d3a","term":"화제","zh":"话题","audio":"/audio/1f7e2fb6cc245d3a31f9.mp3","entryId":"87601","definition":"可谈论的材料或素材。","pronunciation":["화제"]},{"id":"5ddf1bf1c10eabe3","term":"모으다","zh":"吸引，集中，聚集","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3","entryId":"74137","definition":"引发人们的注意力或兴趣。","pronunciation":["모으다"]}],"audio":"/audio/16dc8283cfb853f55003.mp3","